WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
Last grammar job:

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.230
the editor’s cut.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.950
Some sentences pile up so many little phrases that the action gets buried.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.820
Keep the ones the reader needs.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:10.950
Cut the rest.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.790
Then read it out loud.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.450
You should hear the verb again.
